⚙️ Step 1: Install Dependencies

```bash id="install_project_deps"
pip install langchain chromadb streamlit pandas beautifulsoup4 openai
```

---

🌐 Step 2: Load Website Content

```python id="website_loader"
from langchain.document_loaders import WebBaseLoader

loader = WebBaseLoader("https://example.com")
website_docs = loader.load()
```

---

📊 Step 3: Load CSV Data

```python id="csv_loader_project"
from langchain.document_loaders import CSVLoader

loader = CSVLoader("data/products.csv")
csv_docs = loader.load()
```

---

🔗 Step 4: Combine Documents

```python id="combine_docs"
documents = website_docs + csv_docs
```

---

✂️ Step 5: Split Documents into Chunks

```python id="split_docs"
from langchain.text_splitter import RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter

splitter = RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter(
    chunk_size=1000,
    chunk_overlap=200
)

chunks = splitter.split_documents(documents)
```

---

🔢 Step 6: Create Embeddings

```python id="embedding_project"
from langchain_openai import OpenAIEmbeddings

embeddings = OpenAIEmbeddings()
```

---

🗂️ Step 7: Store Embeddings in ChromaDB

```python id="chroma_project"
from langchain.vectorstores import Chroma

vector_store = Chroma.from_documents(
    documents=chunks,
    embedding=embeddings
)
```

---

🔍 Step 8: Create Retriever

```python id="retriever_project"
retriever = vector_store.as_retriever(
    search_kwargs={"k": 4}
)
```

---

🤖 Step 9: Create QA Chain

```python id="qa_project"
from langchain.chains import RetrievalQA
from langchain_openai import ChatOpenAI

llm = ChatOpenAI(model="gpt-4")

qa_chain = RetrievalQA.from_chain_type(
    llm=llm,
    retriever=retriever
)
```

---

🌐 Step 10: Build Streamlit Interface

```python id="streamlit_project"
import streamlit as st

st.title("🌐 Website + CSV Knowledge Chatbot")

query = st.text_input("Ask a question")

if query:
    response = qa_chain.run(query)
    st.write(response)
```

